 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Rows [amount, merchantId, status, userId, startTime]. Inferred time model: startTime and currentTime are integer epoch seconds and hoursBetween = floor((currentTime - startTime) / 3600). A transaction is recent iff status is COMPLETED and 0 <= hoursBetween < 24. Return [merchantId, total amount with exactly two decimals, count] per merchant with recent transactions, sorted by merchantId. Amounts are exact decimals with at most two fractional digits.",
